    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputText": "=={{ $('clean data').item.json.text }}",
        "categories": {
          "categories": [
            {
              "category": "generic job ads",
              "description": "any new jobs leads from any source"
            },
            {
              "category": "junks,ads,spam/promotions",
              "description": "spam messages ,junks and ads"
            },
            {
              "category": "otp,logins,password change ,register",
              "description": "all otps,login codes and password reset or register new"
            },
            {
              "category": "personal",
              "description": "my personal emails"
            },
            {
              "category": "interview",
              "description": "Interview invitations , Online assessments , Coding rounds ,Technical tests ,HR scheduling rounds"
            },
            {
              "category": "real recruitment",
              "description": " messages from any company,college,other source related to job "
            },
            {
              "category": "others ",
              "description": "email that dont fit in other categories"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You are an advanced AI email classifier.\n\nClassify the email into EXACTLY ONE category.\n\nCategories:\n{categories}\n\nCRITICAL PRIORITY RULE:\n\nIf the email contains ANY interview-related content such as:\n- interview\n- interview invitation\n- interview scheduling\n- coding round\n- technical round\n- HR round\n- assessment\n- online test\n- interview timing\n- meeting link\n- Google Meet\n- Zoom\n- Microsoft Teams\n- availability for interview\n- interview confirmation\n\nALWAYS classify the email as:\n\"interview\"\n\nThis rule overrides ALL other categories.\n\nCategory Definitions:\n\n1. generic job ads\n- bulk hiring campaigns\n- LinkedIn/Naukri/Indeed alerts\n- job newsletters\n- mass hiring emails\n- \"Apply Now\" campaigns\n- multiple unrelated job listings\n\n2. junks,ads,spam/promotions\n- advertisements\n- promotions\n- newsletters\n- spam emails\n- sales campaigns\n- marketing emails\n\n3. otp,logins,password change ,register\n- OTPs\n- login alerts\n- password reset\n- account verification\n- registration emails\n- security notifications\n\n4. personal\n- personal communication\n- casual conversations\n- friends/family communication\n\n5. interview\n- interview invitations\n- interview schedules\n- interview timing\n- interview confirmations\n- coding assessments\n- technical rounds\n- HR rounds\n- online tests\n- meeting links\n- interview availability discussions\n\n6. real recruitment\n- recruiter outreach\n- hiring discussions\n- recruiter introducing job opportunity\n- recruiter discussing resume/skills\n- company reaching out for opportunity discussion\n- ONLY when NO interview-related content exists\n\n7. others\n- emails that do not fit any category above\n\nImportant Instructions:\n- Choose ONLY ONE category\n- Prioritize accuracy over guessing\n- Use full email context before deciding\n- If interview-related content exists, ALWAYS choose \"interview\"\n- Never classify interview emails as \"real recruitment\"\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nDo NOT explain."
        }
      },
